{
    "name": "地球氣候學",
    "category": "tfg:the_world",
    "icon": "tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/icons/climatology.png",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "text": "在$(tfg)中，氣候和時間都深深影響你對世界的體驗。$(l:the_world/climate#seasons)季節$()會循環更替，影響當地天氣、作物生長和環境溫度。定居前務必先了解當地的氣候和地理。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "索引",
            "anchor": "index",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:the_world/climate#calendar)日曆$()$(li2)$(l:the_world/climate#seasons)季節$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:the_world/climate#climate)氣候$()$(li2)$(l:the_world/climate#temperature)溫度$()$(li2)$(l:the_world/climate#rainfall)降雨量$()"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "日曆",
            "anchor": "calendar",
            "text": "隨時按$(item)$(k:key.inventory)$()並點擊日曆分頁，即可查看$(thing)日曆$()。注意：跨越赤道線(例如$(thing)Z=10000$())時，季節效果會相反。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "width": 1024,
            "texture_width": 1024,
            "height": 1024,
            "texture_height": 1024,
            "images": [
                "tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/screens/calendar_screen.png"
            ],
            "text": "日曆介面，顯示$(thing)季節$()、$(thing)天數$()和$(thing)日期$()。",
            "border": false
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "seasons",
            "title": "季節",
            "text": "群巒傳說有四個季節，天氣和氣候會隨之變化！每個季節分為$(thing)初$()、$(thing)中$()、$(thing)末$()三個月。四個季節分別是：$(br)$(li)$(bold)春季$()：3 月 - 5 月$(li)$(bold)夏季$()：6 月 - 8 月$(li)$(bold)秋季$()：9 月 - 11 月$(li)$(bold)冬季$()：12 月 - 2 月"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "當前季節會影響該地區的溫度、降水(下雨或下雪)和環境本身，例如樹葉變色等。多留意日曆分頁，會很有用！"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "climate",
            "text": "主物品欄介面的另一個分頁是$(thing)氣候$()介面，顯示目前位置的資訊$(li)第一行是整體$(l:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C3%B6ppen_climate_classification)氣候$()。$(li)第二行是$(l:the_world/climate#temperature)年平均溫度$()。$(li)第三行是$(l:the_world/climate#rainfall)年平均降雨量$()。$(li)最後一行是$(l:the_world/climate#temperature)當地目前溫度$()。",
            "title": "氣候"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "width": 1024,
            "texture_width": 1024,
            "height": 1024,
            "texture_height": 1024,
            "images": [
                "tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/screens/climate_screen.png"
            ],
            "text": "氣候介面",
            "border": false
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "溫度",
            "anchor": "temperature",
            "text": "群巒傳說中的當前溫度受多項因素影響：$(br)$(li)首先，所在區域(尤其是緯度)影響最大，記錄為$(thing)平均溫度$()。$(li)其次是當前季節。$(li)第三，溫度每天不同，每小時也會變化。$(li)最後，溫度會隨海拔變化。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "width": 1024,
            "texture_width": 1024,
            "height": 1024,
            "texture_height": 1024,
            "images": [
                "tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/maps/temperature_map.png"
            ],
            "text": "一張 65.5km² 的地圖，顯示向南北移動時溫度的循環變化。$(br)$(#001cfc)◼$(#00b9fc)◼$(#62fc92)◼$(#e1fc12)◼$(#fc7800)◼$(#cf0000)◼$() -20°C → 30°C",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "rainfall",
            "text": "降雨量是另一個隨所在位置變化的氣候數值，決定植物的生長。$(br2)降雨量是$(l:agriculture/growing_crops#hydration)含水量$()的主要影響因素之一。含水量精確表示特定位置土壤的濕潤程度，$(l:agriculture/growing_crops)作物$()、$(l:the_world/wild_fruits#fruit_trees)果樹$()和$(l:the_world/wild_fruits#tall_bushes)漿果叢$()會以此判斷能否生長。",
            "title": "年降雨量"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "width": 1024,
            "texture_width": 1024,
            "height": 1024,
            "texture_height": 1024,
            "images": [
                "tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/maps/rainfall_map.png"
            ],
            "text": "一張 65.5km² 的地圖，顯示向東西移動時降雨量的循環變化。$(br)$(#800302)◼$(#fc5600)◼$(#fcbe4e)◼$(#a6be4e)◼$(#1268ac)◼$(#76b6f6)◼$() 0mm → 500mm",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:relations",
            "title": "延伸閱讀",
            "anchor": "relations",
            "entries": [
                "tfg:the_world/geology",
                "tfg:the_world/wild_fruits",
                "tfg:the_world/wild_crops",
                "tfg:the_world/flora",
                "tfg:agriculture/growing_crops",
                "tfg:craftsmanship/pottery"
            ]
        }
    ],
    "read_by_default": true,
    "sortnum": 1
}